      "en": "The Amazon SageMaker DeepAR forecasting algorithm is specifically designed for forecasting scalar\n(one-dimensional) time series data using recurrent neural networks (RNNs). It excels when trained on\ndatasets containing hundreds of related time series, enabling it to learn patterns across multiple series and\nprovide accurate forecasts.\nReference:"
