      "en": "Chain-of-thought prompting is a technique in prompt engineering where the AI model is encouraged to\nbreak down its reasoning process step by step to solve a problem, such as numerical reasoning\nchallenges. By explicitly instructing the model to \"show its work by explaining its reasoning step by step,\"\nthe practitioner ensures the model provides a logical sequence of intermediate steps leading to the\nsolution. This improves the accuracy and transparency of the model's outputs, particularly for complex\nreasoning tasks."
