      "en": "ReAct prompting interleaves the model’s chain-of-thought reasoning with explicit “actions” (such as calling\nyour real-time inventory API), then uses the API response to inform its final answer. By structuring your\nprompts to have the LLM think, choose the “CheckInventory” action with the product name, receive the live\nlocation data, and then respond to the user, you seamlessly integrate real-time lookups and precise\nproduct locations into the chatbot’s replies."
