      "en": "A financial company is training a generative AI model to predict outcomes of loan applications. The training dataset is small. The dataset categorizes loan applicants as “younger-aged,” “middle-aged,” or “older- aged.” Most individuals in the dataset are characterized as \"middle-aged.\" The company removes the age range feature from the training dataset. Which model behavior will likely happen as a result of this change to the dataset?"
