      "zh": "一家医疗保健公司正在开发一个文档管理系统，用于将医学研究论文存储在亚马逊 S3 存储桶中。该公司需要一个全面的元数据框架，以提高用于通用人工智能（GenAI）应用的搜索精度。元数据必须包含文档的时间戳、作者信息以及研究领域分类。该解决方案必须在所有上传的文档中保持一致的元数据结构，并允许基础模型（FMs）在不访问完整内容的情况下理解文档的上下文。哪种解决方案能满足这些要求？",
      "en": "A healthcare company is developing a document management system that stores medical research papers in an Amazon S3 bucket. The company needs a comprehensive metadata framework to improve search precision for a GenAI application. The metadata must include document timestamps, author information, and research domain classifications. The solution must maintain a consistent metadata structure across all uploaded documents and allow foundation models (FMs) to understand document context without accessing full content. Which solution will meet these requirements?"
