      "en": "A company is creating a generative AI (GenAI) application that uses Amazon Bedrock foundation models (FMs). The application must use Microsoft Entra ID to authenticate. All FM API calls must stay on private network paths. Access to the application must be limited by department to specific model families. The company also needs a comprehensive audit trail of model interactions. Which solution will meet these requirements?"
