      "zh": "一所大学正在开发一个由人工智能驱动的应用程序，该程序包含多个子应用程序。这些子应用程序包括 AI 助手、作业评分器和内部分析应用程序。该大学正在使用各种基础模型（FMs）定义和测试多个提示。该大学希望比较每个提示的不同变体，并选择最适合特定用例的变体。该大学需要一个提示版本控制解决方案。该大学必须能够测试提示变体，并收集提示更改和使用的审计跟踪。该解决方案还必须在允许提示集成到主应用程序的同时保持一致性。哪种解决方案组合能够以最低的操作开销满足这些要求？（选择两个。）",
      "en": "A university is building an AI-powered application that includes several sub-applications. The sub- applications include AI assistants, assignment graders, and internal analytics applications. The university is defining and testing multiple prompts by using various foundation models (FMs). The university wants to compare variants of each prompt and choose the variant that yield outputs that are best-suited for specified use cases. The university requires a version control solution for the prompts. The university must be able to test prompt variations and collect audit trails for prompt changes and usage. The solution must also maintain consistency while allowing the prompts to integrate into the main application. Which combination of solutions will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead? (Select TWO.)"
