    "explanation": {
      "zh": "正确的组合是 C 和 D，因为它们共同实现了对模型访问和提示内容控制的集中治理，而这正是该场景的两个核心要求。为确保员工仅能使用经批准的亚马逊 Bedrock 模型，必须在组织层面实施治理措施，而不能依赖于单个应用程序的逻辑。服务控制策略（SCP）是 AWS 组织中可用的最强控制机制，因为它定义了账户或主体所能拥有的最大权限。在选项 C 中， SCP 会阻止任何对亚马逊 Bedrock 模型的调用，除非指定了中央批准的防护栏标识符。这确保了防护栏始终得到执行，无论调用源自何处或以何种方式发起。此外，使用 IAM 权限边界可确保即使在允许的账户内，员工也只能调用明确批准的基础模型。为防止特定主题和专有信息出现在提示中，必须使用亚马逊 Bedrock 安全护栏。安全护栏在模型调用期间实时运行，能够在模型处理之前拦截不允许的内容。选项 D 正确指定了一个阻止过滤策略，当必须完全阻止内容而非部分屏蔽时，此策略是合适的。使用 AWS CloudFormation StackSets 部署安全护栏，使公司能够集中管理并在组织内的所有账户中一致部署相同的护栏配置，从而确保统一执行。选项 E 使用掩码过滤，这种方法更适合对敏感输出进行遮蔽，而非防止在提示中提交违禁内容。选项 B 试图仅使用安全控制点（SCPs），但未强制部署防护栏或进行内容过滤。选项 A 错误地将防护栏的执行置于权限边界内，而权限边界并非用于验证诸如防护栏标识符之类的请求参数。通过将基于 SCP 的执行与集中部署的 Bedrock 安全防护措施相结合，选项 C 和 D 共同为整个组织的内容安全和模型治理提供了强大、可扩展且集中管理的控制措施。",
      "en": "The correct combination is because together they enforce centralized governance over both C and D model and , which are the two core requirements of the scenario. access prompt content controls To ensure employees can use , governance must be enforced at the only approved Amazon Bedrock models organization level and not rely on individual application logic. are the Service Control Policies (SCPs) strongest control mechanism available in AWS Organizations because they define the maximum permissions an account or principal can have. In option , the SCP prevents any Amazon Bedrock model invocation C unless a centrally approved guardrail identifier is specified. This ensures that guardrails are always enforced, regardless of how or where the invocation originates. The additional use of IAM permissions boundaries ensures that even within allowed accounts, employees are restricted to invoking only explicitly approved foundation models. To prevent , specific topics and proprietary information from being included in prompts Amazon must be used. Guardrails operate inline during model invocation and can block Bedrock Guardrails disallowed content before it is processed by the model. Option correctly specifies a , D block filtering policy which is appropriate when content must be prevented entirely rather than partially redacted. Deploying the guardrail using allows the company to centrally manage and consistently AWS CloudFormation StackSets deploy the same guardrail configuration across all accounts in the organization, ensuring uniform enforcement. Option uses mask filtering, which is better suited for redacting sensitive output rather than preventing E prohibited content from being submitted in prompts. Option attempts to use SCPs alone but does not B enforce guardrail deployment or content filtering. Option incorrectly places guardrail enforcement in A permissions boundaries, which are not designed to validate request parameters such as guardrail identifiers. By combining with , options SCP-based enforcement centrally deployed Bedrock guardrails C and D together provide strong, scalable, and centrally managed controls for both content safety and model governance across the organization."
    },
