          "text": "Use Amazon SageMaker Processing and Amazon Transcribe to pre-process multimodal data. Ingest curated summaries into an Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases. Apply Amazon Bedrock guardrails to restrict speculative outputs. Use AWS AppConfig to manage prompt templates. Use AWS CloudTrail to log research activity for audits."
