      "en": "A financial services company is developing an AI-powered search assistant application to help investment advisors quickly retrieve investment data. The application runs as an AWS Lambda function. The company is using Amazon Bedrock to develop the application by using an Amazon Bedrock knowledge base that uses Amazon OpenSearch Serverless as its data source. The application agent must manage collections at scale by automatically assigning access permissions to collections and indexes that match a specific pattern. The company uses Amazon Bedrock tools to test the knowledge base. The knowledge base sync process finishes successfully. However, the test reveals a 400 Bad Authorization error from the BedrockAgentRuntime API and a 403 Forbidden error when the test attempts to access OpenSearch Serverless. The company must resolve the permissions issues. Which combination of solutions will meet this requirement? (Select TWO.)"
