      "en": "A medical company is creating a generative AI (GenAI) system by using Amazon Bedrock. The system processes data from various sources and must maintain end-to-end data lineage. The system must also use real- time personally identifiable information (PII) filtering and audit trails to automatically report compliance. Which solution will meet these requirements?"
