      "en": "A financial services company is developing a customer service AI assistant application that uses a foundation model (FM) in Amazon Bedrock. The application must provide transparent responses by documenting reasoning and by citing sources that are used for Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG). The application must capture comprehensive audit trails for all responses to users. The application must be able to serve up to 10,000 concurrent users and must respond to each customer inquiry within 2 seconds. Which solution will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead?"
