      "zh": "这一系列复杂的需求最好通过亚马逊 Bedrock 提示管理来解决。它支持创建参数化提示，其中变量（如人口统计信息）可以在运行时注入，从而确保使用一致的医学术语，同时根据特定患者的情况调整建议。提示管理原生支持版本控制和审批工作流，这是临床安全和合规性的要求。为了审计和保留，可以配置 Bedrock 模型调用日志记录，将详细的提示和响应数据发送到亚马逊 S3。将这些日志存储在 S3 中可满足 2 年的保留要求，并便于本地审计。与仅使用 CloudWatch Logs 相比，S3 对长期存储更具成本效益。CloudTrail（选项 A）仅记录管理事件，而不记录医疗审计所需的实际提示/响应内容。",
      "en": "This complex set of requirements is best addressed by . It allows the Amazon Bedrock Prompt Management creation of where variables (like demographics) can be injected at runtime, ensuring parameterized prompts consistent medical terminology while adapting recommendations to the specific patient. Prompt Management natively supports , which is a requirement for clinical safety and versioning and approval workflows compliance. For audit and retention, can be configured to send detailed Bedrock model invocation logging prompt and response data to . Storing these logs in S3 supports the 2-year retention requirement Amazon S3 and facilitates local audits. S3 is more cost-effective for long-term storage than CloudWatch Logs alone. CloudTrail (Option A) only logs management events, not the actual prompt/response content required for medical auditing."
