      "en": "A company deploys multiple Amazon Bedrock–based generative AI (GenAI) applications across multiple business units for customer service, content generation, and document analysis. Some applications show unpredictable token consumption patterns. The company requires a comprehensive observability solution that provides real-time visibility into token usage patterns across multiple models. The observability solution must support custom dashboards for multiple stakeholder groups and provide alerting capabilities for token consumption across all the foundation models that the company’s applications use. Which combination of solutions will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead? (Select TWO.)"
