      "zh": "一家公司正在利用亚马逊 Bedrock 开发一款生成式人工智能（GenAI）应用程序。该应用程序将分析公司数据中的模式和关系。每天，该应用程序将在欧洲、北美和亚洲的 AWS 区域处理数百万个新的数据点，然后将数据存储在亚马逊 S3 中。该应用程序必须符合当地的数据保护和存储法规。数据驻留和处理必须在同一大陆内进行。该应用程序还必须保留应用程序决策过程的审计记录，并提供数据分类功能。哪种解决方案能满足这些要求？",
      "en": "A company is developing a generative AI (GenAI) application by using Amazon Bedrock. The application will analyze patterns and relationships in the company’s data. The application will process millions of new data points daily across AWS Regions in Europe, North America, and Asia before storing the data in Amazon S3. The application must comply with local data protection and storage regulations. Data residency and processing must occur within the same continent. The application must also maintain audit trails of the application’s decision-making processes and provide data classification capabilities. Which solution will meet these requirements?"
