      "zh": "一家金融服务公司希望使用亚马逊 Bedrock 基础模型（FMs）来分析呼叫中心的录音。当通话结束时，呼叫中心会将录音以 MP3 文件的形式存储在亚马逊 S3 存储桶中。该公司需要在新文件创建后立即以结构化格式生成录音的摘要和情感分析。这些录音的平均大小为 20MB。以下哪两种解决方案组合可以满足这些要求？（选择两项。）",
      "en": "A financial services company wants to use Amazon Bedrock foundation models (FMs) to analyze call center recordings. When calls end, the call center stores recordings as MP3 files in an Amazon S3 bucket. The company needs to generate summaries and sentiment analysis for the recordings in a structured format as soon as new files are created. The recordings average 20 MB in size. Which combination of solutions will meet these requirements? (Select TWO.)"
