          "label": "A",
          "text": "Use an Amazon API Gateway REST API with a Regional endpoint to receive webhook requests and invoke AWS Lambda functions. Configure Lambda authorizers to validate all the webhook authentication methods. Configure the Lambda functions to call Amazon Bedrock to perform sentiment analysis and generate responses. Store results in Amazon DynamoDB global tables to provide multi- Region availability."
