      "zh": "一家公司正在使用 AWS Lambda 和 REST API 构建一个推理代理，以实现支持工作流程的自动化。该系统必须在交互过程中保留内存，共享相关代理状态，并支持事件驱动调用和同步调用。该系统还必须实施访问控制和基于会话的权限。哪两种步骤的组合能提供最具可扩展性的解决方案？（选择两项。）",
      "en": "A company is using AWS Lambda and REST APIs to build a reasoning agent to automate support workflows. The system must preserve memory across interactions, share relevant agent state, and support event-driven invocation and synchronous invocation. The system must also enforce access control and session-based permissions. Which combination of steps provides the MOST scalable solution? (Select TWO.)"
